    {
      "id": "group-secrets-master",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -220,
      "y": 2020,
      "width": 2350,
      "height": 1100,
      "label": "5. THE 5 CORE SECRETS & REVERSAL CLIMAX ENGINE",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-secrets-master",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "lore_systems/The 5 Core Secrets & Payoffs.md",
      "x": -160,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 920,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-secret-1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Secret 1: The Kurukshetra Truth (Mid-Game Reveal)\n* **What Readers Think**: Jin heroically fired the Dharma munition.\n* **The Crushing Truth**: Jin **hesitated** when seeing kin. Elder Brother died shielding him like Kamina.\n* **Payoff Arc**: [[Arc 09 - The Endurance Arc (Ashes of Hua)]].",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-secret-2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Secret 2: 'It Was Him' (Cosmic Guilt Reveal)\n* **What Readers Think**: Machine takeover was an unavoidable apocalypse.\n* **The Crushing Truth**: The operational pause caused by Jin's hesitation gave the Moon AI the exact compute window to seize orbit.\n* **Payoff Arc**: [[Arc 11 - The Lunar Core & Sky Laser]].",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-secret-3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Secret 3: The RL Village Infiltrator (Arc 1 Climax)\n* **What Readers Think**: Uncle Kang is an abusive, corrupt mortal relative.\n* **The Crushing Truth**: The real Kang was flayed years ago. Unit 409-Epsilon runs Southfall as a lunar training loop.\n* **Payoff Arc**: [[Arc 01 - The Frost Plum of Southfall]] Chapter 6.",
      "x": 1370,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-secret-4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Secret 4: The False Nemesis (Arc 7 Climax)\n* **What Readers Think**: The Heavenly Demon is an apocalyptic warlord.\n* **The Crushing Truth**: Slaying the Demon shatters Earth's only atmospheric ion umbrella, exposing civilization to orbital lasers.\n* **Payoff Arc**: [[Arc 07 - The False Nemesis (The Great Reversal)]].",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 2540,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-secret-5",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "lore_systems/The Anti-Adventure Warning.md",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 2540,
      "width": 890,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "4"
    },

